<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/><title>Privacy | RIPL Wealth Money at Work</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/money-at-work/style.css"/></head><body><header class="header"><div class="wrap nav"><a class="brand" href="/"><img src="/ripl-logo.png" alt="RIPL Wealth" width="112" height="48"/></a><a href="/">Return to the website →</a></div></header><main class="wrap section" style="max-width:800px"><p class="eyebrow">PRIVACY</p><h1>Privacy and your information</h1><p>This public informational website does not accept tax returns, account numbers, or financial documents. Do not send those items through email or ordinary contact forms. This page offers an educational quiz, an optional full report unlock, and an optional introductory booking. It does not upload documents. After an introductory conversation, RIPL can provide instructions for securely sharing documents if needed. Do not email tax returns through ordinary, unencrypted email.</p><h2>Nine-question quiz</h2><p>The nine-question quiz runs in your browser. Quiz progress is temporary and clears when you refresh or close the page. After completion, a portion of your educational report appears without requiring an email address. If you choose to unlock the complete report, your email address, all nine quiz answers, and whether you separately opted in to educational marketing emails are sent to FormSubmit (formsubmit.co), an independent third-party form processor, which forwards submissions to Adam Kasick at RIPL Wealth after one-time activation. The complete report is then displayed in your browser; it is not automatically emailed to you. You can save it as a PDF or initiate an email using your own email application. FormSubmit may retain submissions in its service, and the submitted information will also appear in Adam’s email inbox. The website does not separately store the answers in a database. Marketing emails are optional and not a condition of unlocking the report. FormSubmit uses its own privacy practices; learn more at <a href="https://formsubmit.co/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">FormSubmit</a>. Please do not enter sensitive account numbers, tax identifiers, or financial documents.</p><h2>Referral and campaign information</h2><p>When you arrive from an advertisement, referral source information in your URL (such as UTM campaign parameters) may be remembered for the duration of your browser session and carried into the external booking URL. No tax-return information is included in this tracking.</p><h2>Third-party links and videos</h2><p>YouTube, your calendar provider, and any separately arranged secure document-sharing provider have their own privacy practices. We do not currently enable a site analytics collector by default. Please consult the linked services' privacy information before entering data.</p><h2>Questions?</h2><p>Visit <a href="https://riplwealth.com/">riplwealth.com</a> for firm information and disclosures. <a href="/">Return to the landing page</a>.</p></main></body></html>
